   "text": "API: ASP.NET Core .NET 10 (MVC)\nRender (Docker): fde-tracker-v3-api\n\nMiddleware: JWT verify · CORS allow-list\nrate limits · body limits · headers\n\nControllers → Services → Repositories\nper-program role checks in Services\nExcel export (ClosedXML)",
   "originalText": "API: ASP.NET Core .NET 10 (MVC)\nRender (Docker): fde-tracker-v3-api\n\nMiddleware: JWT verify · CORS allow-list\nrate limits · body limits · headers\n\nControllers → Services → Repositories\nper-program role checks in Services\nExcel export (ClosedXML)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
